      <title>NASA放弃救援Swift天文台，功勋望远镜将坠入大气层</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260820/NASA%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E6%95%91%E6%8F%B4Swift%E5%A4%A9%E6%96%87%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%9F%E5%8B%8B%E6%9C%9B%E8%BF%9C%E9%95%9C%E5%B0%86%E5%9D%A0%E5%85%A5%E5%A4%A7%E6%B0%94%E5%B1%82/</link>
